. * 4) Regression-ready transforms
. *----------------------------
. xtset panel_id quarter_date

Panel variable: panel_id (unbalanced)
 Time variable: quarter_date, 2014q1 to 2025q1, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 quarter

. 
. * High inflation (>3%)
. gen byte high_inf = (inflation > 3) if !missing(inflation)
(653 missing values generated)

